      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bethany_Beach%2C_Delaware"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The South Coastal Library opened in 1994, offering residents and visitors a quiet place to explore local history and literature.",
